module Core

### Represents the protocol for explicit deep or logical copying.
### `Copyable` is used for values that can produce an independent duplicate of
### themselves without sharing externally visible mutable state.
protocol Copyable
  ### Returns a copy of this value.
  ### Implementations should preserve the observable contents of the original
  ### value while giving the result its own valid lifetime and invariants.
  ### :returns: A copy of this value.
  @readonly
  routine Me.copy() -> Me
